# Working research. NEVER publish this folder.
#
# It holds the raw output of the sweeps that built this kit, and that output is
# full of one specific person's private detail: a real name, an email address, a
# GitHub handle, home directory paths, and the names of private projects.
#
# This file has to exist BEFORE the first commit. Git history is append-only, so
# deleting something in a later commit does not remove it from the history. If any
# of _research/ has already been committed, the fix is to rebuild the history, not
# to delete the files.
_research/

# Internal working state for THIS repo. Never published.
#
# These two were tracked until 2026-08-03 and were caught one push away from going
# out. A cross-vendor review found them while every earlier privacy check watched
# _research/ and nothing else. HANDOFF.md named the first reader, described her in
# the third person, carried an instruction not to send the repo to her, and stated
# star counts, which the repo's own rules ban as a popularity claim. The wiki said
# the same things in more detail. They now live in _research/internal/.
#
# Root-anchored on purpose: the `.claude/wiki/` that START-HERE and the templates
# tell a READER to create lives in THEIR project, and must keep working.
/HANDOFF.md
/.claude/

